  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan recalls that with only dream path mortal Gu and no dream path Immortal Gu, his previous life’s dream-realm exploration made no important discoveries and left him chased and suppressed by large forces. Dream realms that have already surfaced can be explored with dream path mortal Gu; those that have not surfaced need dream path Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        734
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "sys_dream_realm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Forces treat dream path as the future trend and keep refined dream path mortal Gu secret as their greatest mysteries. Fang Yuan knows many dream path mortal Gu recipes, but mortal Gu alone are not enough for serious dream-realm exploration; otherwise major forces would already explore en masse.",
      "chapters": [
        763
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hidden-research",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_mortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Refinement materials for dream path mortal Gu can only be found in dream realms. The whole process must be executed personally, and only materials from one’s own dream realm can refine those Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        766
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "own-dream-materials",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_refinement"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan enters his dream realm, refines dream path mortal Gu there, and stores them in his mind.",
      "chapters": [
        778
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "own-dream-materials",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He refines enough dream path mortal Gu to form the immortal killer move Unravel Dream with Unravel Mystery Immortal Gu as the core.",
      "chapters": [
        773
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "unravel-dream-expenditure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_unravel_dream",
        "gu_unravel_mystery"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Unravel Mystery can be reused, but the supplementary dream path mortal Gu are expended with continuous use, so he spends time each day refining more from his own dream realm.",
      "chapters": [
        915
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "unravel-dream-expenditure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dream path is still in its infancy. Only super forces research it, so dream path mortal Gu recipes have immense value.",
      "chapters": [
        983
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "recipe-value",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_dream"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At one period Fang Yuan rates those recipes higher than Immortal Gu and refuses to hand production to Lang Ya Sect, because leaking them would erase his dream-realm exploration advantage.",
      "chapters": [
        1232
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "recipe-value",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_lang_ya_sect"
      ]
    }
  ],
